{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-typed-conservative.md","title":"原书全归纳 TB 和 UTB 均对 PA 保守","display":"thm-typed-conservative — 原书全归纳 TB 和 UTB 均对 PA 保守","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-typed-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-typed-conservative"],"display":"thm-typed-conservative — 原书全归纳 TB 和 UTB 均对 PA 保守","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-typed-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-typed-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-typed-conservative — 原书全归纳 TB 和 UTB 均对 PA 保守"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定基础算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> 是原书含完整真理语言归纳的版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n[\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi]\n\\quad\\land\\quad[\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n[\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi]\n\\quad\\land\\quad[\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对有限真理理论证明，只取其中实际使用的有限双条件矩阵，为其复杂度构造算术部分真理定义。用此定义统一替代证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，双条件和闭项参数的实例在 PA 中可证；全部含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的归纳也变成允许的算术归纳。于是算术结论已有 PA 证明。\n不能仅给任意 PA 模型的标准句子编码赋正确真值，就声称该扩张满足完整真理语言归纳；旧模型证明未验证这一点，已用原书的有限替换证明替代。\n“有类型”并不普遍保证保守性，CT 即是全归纳有类型而非保守的理论。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5 及证明，印刷页 55–56，PDF 页 66–67。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n[\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi]\n\\quad\\land\\quad[\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1510,"backlinks":[{"id":"37a053154986e417","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f626099313d4c0b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ 是 [[91-thm-typed-conservative]] 使用的原书全归纳版本。\n$\\bot$ 为固定算术矛盾句，\n$\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq S\\nvdash\\bot$。"},{"id":"8ed8a780d077dd76","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","4a1d989a5f615933"]}